ideouts where they come across his research data, which could tip the outcome of the Fourth Great War. Meanwhile, Sasuke finally sets out to settle his score with Naruto.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-09-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5z3h4Dw0zaKN4VLwFHhsUhQDDOU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5z3h4Dw0zaKN4VLwFHhsUhQDDOU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/331"},{"id":"1084752","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":332,"title":{"value":"Determinazione granitica","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Five Kage are outmatched by the real Madara Uchiha’s devastating attacks. Just when Third Tsuchikage Ohnoki is about to give up, he remembers the words of the previous Tsuchikage.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-09-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6VE542qJ6DUxwQcjjumrVgCVxfH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6VE542qJ6DUxwQcjjumrVgCVxfH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/332"},{"id":"1084753","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":333,"title":{"value":"I rischi della tecnica della resurrezione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tsunade leaves her post as Medic Ninja to join the other Kage in fighting Madara. Meanwhile, Sasuke goes after Itachi and learns that his brother intends on stopping Kabuto’s Reanimation Jutsu.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-10-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n325jajBAIEWEmjGzHIP33MSfHB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n325jajBAIEWEmjGzHIP33MSfHB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/333"},{"id":"1084754","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":334,"title":{"value":"Fratelli che combattono insieme","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sasuke and Itachi team up to stop Kabuto’s Reanimation Jutsu. But Kabuto’s new ability to use Nature Energy has made him a difficult target for the brothers to land their Susano’o attack.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-10-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ne0C8gEZlE7KAXsPXzLjIrAGrTB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ne0C8gEZlE7KAXsPXzLjIrAGrTB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/334"},{"id":"1084755","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":335,"title":{"value":"Tutto per la foglia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kabuto attempts to bring Sasuke over to his side by pointing out that they both are fighting for the same goal: to bring down the Leaf Village. But Sasuke quickly rejects him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-10-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a58QQ3PTWLZgRSJHIYxoawnt2t5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a58QQ3PTWLZgRSJHIYxoawnt2t5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/335"},{"id":"1084756","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":336,"title":{"value":"Kabuto Yakushi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kabuto’s past is finally revealed. As child, a woman named Nonou raised Kabuto at an orphanage in the Leaf Village. One day, Danzo and Orochimaru visit the orphanage to provide financial aid under the condition that Nonou work as their spy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-10-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lnh90rmY0FS6e20qU1g829lkrGp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lnh90rmY0FS6e20qU1g829lkrGp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/336"},{"id":"1084757","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":337,"title":{"value":"Attivazione: Izanami!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Casting aside Itachi's lectures to him, Kabuto reveals to the siblings that he had injected himself with the DNA of various shinobi, namely the Sound Five, also including Orochimaru.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-11-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kGQOjGDcGIVHaZcscWTLRPFj6uW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kGQOjGDcGIVHaZcscWTLRPFj6uW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/337"},{"id":"1084758","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":338,"title":{"value":"Izanagi e Izanami","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With Izanami activated, and Kabuto trapped within its infinite loop, Sasuke uses this time to question his brother about the technique. Itachi tells Sasuke about the history behind Izanami's creation as well as the Uchiha clan's use of the technique.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-11-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dSSqYBJ2ySxCuAuj09zRqmBNDuF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dSSqYBJ2ySxCuAuj09zRqmBNDuF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/338"},{"id":"1084759","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":339,"title":{"value":"Ti amerò sempre","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Back at the front lines, the five Kage struggle to hold their own against Madara's Susanoo-clad wood clones.  As the lights surrounding the reincarnated shinobi begin to illuminate the battlefield as they faded into pillars of light, Itachi approaches Sasuke and uses his Sharingan to show Sasuke everything about the Uchiha clan massacre.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-11-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8A6FVWR5Ny1m922XGibyD5KhM5u.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8A6FVWR5Ny1m922XGibyD5KhM5u.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/339"},{"id":"1084760","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":340,"title":{"value":"Tecnica della resurrezione: rilascio!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Thanks to Itachi, the Reanimation Jutsu is released, and all the Reanimated Shinobi are returned to their resting places. But to everyone’s surprise, the real Madara still remains!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-11-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lPmxb82lJYJOTrPP00quhpwhwjX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lPmxb82lJYJOTrPP00quhpwhwjX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/340"},{"id":"1084761","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":341,"title":{"value":"Il ritorno di Orochimaru","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Suigetsu and Jugo finally catch up to Sasuke. In order to learn the truth behind the Leaf’s actions, Sasuke decides to resurrect the one man who can help him find the answer—Orochimaru.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-12-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pB5wIpN0LV9PxzHOlf5MqyH1kS6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pB5wIpN0LV9PxzHOlf5MqyH1kS6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/341"},{"id":"1084762","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":342,"title":{"value":"Il segreto della tecnica spazio-temporale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Having absorbed the chakras of all nine Tailed Beasts, the Gedo Statue begins its transformation into Ten Tails. Naruto, Killer Bee, Kakashi, and Guy try to destroy the Gedo Statue but are stopped by the masked man.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-12-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lDzd8D5v3gLVZiBx8ScTHTonY6g.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lDzd8D5v3gLVZiBx8ScTHTonY6g.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/342"},{"id":"1084763","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":343,"title":{"value":"Chi sei?","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kakashi discovers a strange connection between the masked man’s Transportation Technique and his own Kamui Jutsu. Naruto throws everything he’s got against the masked man and breaks his mask, finally revealing his identity!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2013-12-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zJFBu463baKeRYpxhMxoLhg0Km3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zJFBu463baKeRYpxhMxoLhg0Km3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/15/episode/343"},{"id":"1084764","seasonNumber":15,"episodeNumber":344,"title":{"value":"Obito e Madara","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The identity of the masked man is revealed to be Kakashi’s old friend Obito, previously believed to have died in the battle of Kannabi Bridge. Naruto and the others are further shocked when they learn that Obito has been working with Madara Uchiha...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2014-01-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x4JI3xzxUOlA8mqP3E0sas1XjLt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x4JI3xz